# Clinical Companion

`FinalProject/app` is Clinical Companion: cited chat on diet, exercise, healthy habits, and related wellbeing. It is informational and does not replace a physician. Diagnosis, treatment, medication advice, EHR, wearables, and native apps are out of this build. Login and user home are backlog only, not Compose services.

Compose project `clinical-companion`, started from `FinalProject/app`:

- Open WebUI `v0.11.3` on port 3000. `WEBUI_AUTH` is off. It signs in to RBAC once and sends that JWT as `OPENAI_API_KEY`.
- Agent on port 8000. FastAPI, OpenAI-compatible `/v1`.
- RBAC on port 8001.
- Weaviate collection `Pilares`. Every PDF in `agent/knowledge` is indexed into it before the agent is healthy. A later start skips that work when those files are unchanged.
- Langfuse on port 3001. Traces stay in this Compose project.

Default chat model is `Qwen/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507` through the Hugging Face router. Embeddings use `sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2`.

Product and architecture decisions are in `FinalProject/wiki/Product-vision.md` and `FinalProject/wiki/Architecture-vision.md`. Mermaid on those pages is the source. PNGs in `wiki/assets/` can lag. Secrets stay in `.env`; do not commit them.
